                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined @SpeakerPelosi, @RosaDeLauro, @FrankPallone, @RepJahanaHayes and @SenStabenow today for a press conference on House Democrats\u2019 work to address the infant formula shortage and ensure children have the nutrition they need to survive and thrive. https://t.co/DqbPL15aoO https://t.co/vgbqYJb0s5",
