                "text": "I thank @POTUS for hosting the first White House Conference on Hunger, Nutrition, and Health in more than 50 years and commend his new strategy to fight hunger and ensure Americans have access to the healthy food they need to learn, grow, and succeed. https://t.co/WdDCT6ACu9",
