                "text": "59 years ago, the Food Stamp Act was signed \u2013 momentous legislation that strengthened the agricultural economy, improved nutrition in low-income households, & gave families peace of mind.\n\nHouse Dems remain committed to protecting SNAP in the upcoming Farm Bill. https://t.co/4IiXYSlo9O",
